@startuml
title Unity Technical Showcase Portfolio Master Plan - 전체 마스터 플랜

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam defaultFontName Malgun Gothic
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
}
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #444444
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

rectangle "최종 목표" as Goal {
  rectangle "기술적으로 설명 가능한\n개발 과정 자체를 포트폴리오화" as PortfolioGoal
  rectangle "연봉 5,000~7,000만원\n중견 이상 게임 회사 이직" as CareerGoal
}

package "전략 계층" as Strategy {
  rectangle "KPI System\nLevel 1~5 완료 기준" as Kpi
  rectangle "Feature Backlog\nMust / Should / Could / Won't" as Backlog
  rectangle "Risk Log\n범위 증가 / 지연 / 과몰입 관리" as Risk
  rectangle "Portfolio Dashboard\n주간 진행률 관리" as Dashboard
  rectangle "Recruiter Mode\n면접관 관점 요약" as Recruiter
  rectangle "DX11 -> Unity Mapping\n차별화 근거" as Mapping
  rectangle "Demo Video Plan\n30초 GIF / 3분 / 10분 영상" as Video
}

package "개발 사이클" as Cycle {
  rectangle "Concept Study\n개념 학습" as Concept
  rectangle "Architecture Design\n설계" as Design
  rectangle "Mini Experiment\n작은 실험" as Experiment
  rectangle "Implementation\n구현" as Implementation
  rectangle "Verification\n검증" as Verification
  rectangle "Git Commit\n기술 단위 커밋" as Commit
  rectangle "Markdown Docs\n문서화" as Docs
  rectangle "PlantUML Update\n구조도 갱신" as Uml
  rectangle "Tistory Blog Draft\n블로그 초안" as Blog
  rectangle "Notion Journal\n개발 일지" as Notion
  rectangle "Interview Notes\n면접 정리" as Interview
}

package "MVP 1순위" as Mvp1 {
  rectangle "Modular Skill System" as SkillSystem
  rectangle "Skill Editor / Tool" as SkillEditor
  rectangle "Technical Showcase Scene" as ShowcaseScene
  rectangle "Feature Toggle System" as FeatureToggle
  rectangle "Before / After Comparison" as Comparison
  rectangle "Metrics View" as Metrics
}

package "MVP 2순위" as Mvp2 {
  rectangle "Animation Tool" as AnimationTool
  rectangle "Animation Event <-> Skill" as AnimationSkill
  rectangle "Shader Showcase" as ShaderShowcase
}

package "MVP 3순위" as Mvp3 {
  rectangle "Optimization Showcase" as Optimization
  rectangle "Rendering Debug View" as DebugView
  rectangle "Blog Series Polish" as BlogPolish
}

package "공통 아키텍처" as Architecture {
  rectangle "INY_Module\\n공통 생명주기" as IFeatureModule
  rectangle "NY_Core_ModuleHub\\nON/OFF / 의존성 / 상태" as ToggleManager
  rectangle "NY_Comparison_ViewSystem\\nBefore/After RenderTexture" as ComparisonSystem
  rectangle "NY_Tool_ModuleDashboard\\n시연 대시보드" as ControlPanel
  rectangle "NY_Core_ModuleMetricsCenter\\nFPS / GC / DrawCall" as MetricsProvider
}

package "산출물" as Outputs {
  rectangle "Unity Project\n실행 가능한 포트폴리오" as UnityProject
  rectangle "GitHub Repository\nSource / README / Docs / UML" as Github
  rectangle "Technical Docs\nMarkdown 기준 문서" as TechnicalDocs
  rectangle "PlantUML Diagrams\n구조 / 시퀀스 / 패키지" as PlantUmlDocs
  rectangle "Tistory Blog Series\n학습과 재설계 기록" as Tistory
  rectangle "Notion Journal\n일일 / 주간 회고" as NotionOutput
  rectangle "Demo Videos\nGIF / 3분 / 10분" as Videos
  rectangle "Interview Package\n1분 / 3분 / 심화 답변" as InterviewPackage
}

package "제외 범위" as OutOfScope {
  rectangle "Server" as Server
  rectangle "DB" as Db
  rectangle "Login" as Login
  rectangle "Matchmaking" as Matchmaking
  rectangle "ECS / DOTS" as Dots
  rectangle "대규모 Addressables 심화" as DeepAddressables
}

PortfolioGoal --> Strategy : 성공 기준 정의
PortfolioGoal --> Cycle : 개발 방식 고정
PortfolioGoal --> Outputs : 최종 산출물
CareerGoal --> Recruiter : 채용 관점 강화
CareerGoal --> InterviewPackage : 면접 대비

Kpi --> Dashboard : 진행률 판단
Backlog --> Dashboard : 범위 통제
Risk --> Dashboard : 위험 추적
Recruiter --> Interview : 면접 관점 반영
Mapping --> Blog : DX11 경험 연결
Video --> Videos : 시연 영상 생성

Concept --> Design
Design --> Experiment
Experiment --> Implementation
Implementation --> Verification
Verification --> Commit
Commit --> Docs
Docs --> Uml
Uml --> Blog
Blog --> Notion
Notion --> Interview
Interview --> Dashboard : 주간 리뷰 반영
Dashboard --> Backlog : 우선순위 조정
Dashboard --> Risk : 리스크 갱신

Mvp1 --> Architecture : 공통 구조 우선 적용
SkillSystem --> FeatureToggle : NY_Module로 ON/OFF
SkillEditor --> ControlPanel : Tool UI 통합
ShowcaseScene --> ControlPanel : 시연 중심 화면
FeatureToggle --> ToggleManager : ModuleHub 중앙 제어
Comparison --> ComparisonSystem : 적용 전후 비교
Metrics --> MetricsProvider : 성능 지표 수집

Mvp2 --> Architecture : MVP 1 이후 확장
AnimationTool --> Mapping : DX11 Animation 경험 연결
ShaderShowcase --> Mapping : DX11 Shader 경험 연결
AnimationSkill --> SkillSystem : 이벤트 연동

Mvp3 --> Architecture : 확장 기능
Optimization --> MetricsProvider : 수치 기반 비교
DebugView --> ComparisonSystem : RenderTexture Debug View
BlogPolish --> Tistory : 게시용 글 정리

IFeatureModule --> ToggleManager : 등록 / 제어
ToggleManager --> ComparisonSystem : Before/After 트리거
ToggleManager --> MetricsProvider : 모듈별 Metrics
ControlPanel --> ToggleManager : Dashboard 사용자 조작
ControlPanel --> ComparisonSystem : View Mode 선택
ControlPanel --> MetricsProvider : Metrics 표시

Implementation --> UnityProject : 기능 통합
Commit --> Github : 변경 이력 저장
Docs --> TechnicalDocs : 설계 문서 저장
Uml --> PlantUmlDocs : 다이어그램 저장
Blog --> Tistory : 글 초안 생성
Notion --> NotionOutput : 개발 일지 작성
Video --> Videos : 시연 자료 생성
Interview --> InterviewPackage : 답변 패키지 생성

Backlog -[#red,dashed]-> Server : Won't
Backlog -[#red,dashed]-> Db : Won't
Backlog -[#red,dashed]-> Login : Won't
Backlog -[#red,dashed]-> Matchmaking : Won't
Backlog -[#red,dashed]-> Dots : Won't
Backlog -[#red,dashed]-> DeepAddressables : 초기 제외

note bottom of Strategy
최상위 질문:
이 기능이 일반 Unity 포트폴리오와 비교해서
어떤 차별성을 만들고 있는가?
end note

note bottom of Cycle
기능 완료 기준:
구현만으로 완료가 아니다.
문서, UML, 블로그 초안, 노션 일지,
면접 정리, Git Commit까지 완료되어야 한다.
end note

@enduml

